{{Quote|Coruscant. The entire planet is one big city.|[[Ric Olié]], to [[Anakin Skywalker]]|<ref name="Episode 1">{{Film|I}}</ref>}}
'''Imperial City''',<ref name="The Rebellion Begins">''[[The Rebellion Begins]]''</ref> formerly called '''Galactic City'''<ref name="UltimateSW" /> and '''Republic City''',<ref name="Temptation of the Force">''[[The High Republic: Temptation of the Force]]''</ref> was the name of the dense [[ecumenopolis]] that covered the surface levels of the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. It comprised the entirety of [[Level 5127]]. Areas of the [[city]] included the [[Federal District|Senate District]], [[The Works]], and [[CoCo Town]]. Built over thousands of [[Standard year|years]], [[The galaxy|Galactic]] City was home to over a trillion individuals.<ref name="UltimateSW" />

Underneath Galactic City were the thousands of lower levels of Coruscant collectively called the [[Coruscant Underworld|underworld]].<ref name="UltimateSW" />

